# fixture: restriction_added_before.ttl
# Purpose: baseline for a restriction addition. ex:Track is a plain class with no
# restrictions. Pairs with restriction_added_after.ttl, where it gains a max 1
# cardinality restriction on ex:hasSpeed — a new constraint that may invalidate
# existing data, so restriction_added is breaking.

@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

ex:Track a owl:Class .
